{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48970","headline":"松 · 卢士衡","name":"松","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"云外千寻好性灵，伴杉陪柏事孤贞。\n招呼暑气终无分，应和凉风别有声。\n细雨洒时花旋落，道人食处叶重生。\n如逢郢匠垂搜采，爲栋爲梁力不轻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢士衡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48970.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48970","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}